++/// The `keyMintVersion` that corresponds to an `attestationVersion`. They agree for KeyMint (>= 100)
++/// but differ for pre-KeyMint Keymaster releases: attestation 2 -> keymaster 3 (Keymaster 3.0),
++/// 3 -> 4 (Keymaster 4.0), 4 -> 41 (Keymaster 4.1). Any other value is passed through unchanged.
